# What must not be uploaded to the deployment.
#
# The site is served from the repo root, so anything left here is a public
# URL. Removing the <script> tag from index.html is not enough on its own —
# without this file /js/guests.js would still be downloadable.

# The guest list. It is the seed source for the database and runs only on
# this machine, via `npm run db:seed`. If you ever put the script tag back
# in index.html you must take this line out too, or the lookup will break.
js/guests.js

# The spreadsheet js/guests.js was transcribed from — same reason.
new_guest_list/

# The track under its WhatsApp name. assets/audio/theme.mp3 is the same
# file byte for byte and is the one the page loads; there is no reason to
# upload three megabytes of it twice.
new_background_music/

# Local tooling and notes — no reason for these to be on the internet.
scripts/
tools/
server/
CLAUDE.md
README.md
.vscode/
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# The preview harness for the static map plan. It is a bare <img> pointed at
# assets/img/map.svg, for looking at what tools/build_map.mjs drew — the repo
# root is served as-is, so without this line it would be a public page.
mapview.html
